('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Approvals/IssueManagerApprovalRequest.cs',10),row('IssueManagerApprovalRequest positional record carries secret Pin,Action and nullable Reason. Compiler constructor/init/with neither authenticates nor verifies action;handler enumerates active users and PBKDF-verifies supplied Pin before registry authority. Generated ToString/PrintMembers would include plaintext Pin,so request must not be logged wholesale;no actual request-object logging sink established by inspected handler/API paths. Scalar string equality compares secret normally,not constant-time authentication;code correctly uses PinHasher rather than record equality.', 'Plaintext approver Pin,action string,reason optional from authenticated station JSON.', 'Request JSON,record equality/copy/ToString behavior;not approval issuance itself.', 'Record construction no DB;handler persists approval separately.', 'Secret input boundary,caller cannot specify authoritative approver ID through this contract;ToString confidentiality potential only unless actual log sink found.', 'IssueManagerApprovalHandler26-46 loads users,verifies and SaveChanges;record no DB.', 'Approval PIN dialog data is transient request;no physical printing or ticket contains this record.', 'Small scalar record;expensive per-active-user hash checking belongs handler,not generated equality.', 'with copy duplicates Pin string reference into another object,not zeroization. Duplicate request can issue new approval because no request id by contract.', ['Generated ToString secret hazard,not demonstrated current leak','Nullability not runtime validation;handler coalesces null Pin'], ['ToString redaction expectation,wrong action/PIN rejection through existing tests only;no auth endpoint executed'], ['IssueManagerApprovalRequest.cs10','IssueManagerApprovalHandler.HandleAsync26-46','CashierWinUI/ApiClient.IssueManagerApprovalAsync675-677','Program.cs1456 approval endpoint'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Approvals/IssueManagerApprovalRequest.cs',15),row('IssueManagerApprovalResult returns ApprovalId,server-resolved approver ID/name,Action and ApprovedAtUtc. All scalar strings/time so generated equality/copy preserves value comparison,but result is not itself proof token unused or still valid;later command registry consumption checks persistent identity/action/state. No Pin included,which narrows output secret exposure. ApprovalId remains bearer-like authorization material and generated ToString includes it;do not indiscriminately log response.', 'Five values from actual registry-created approval,not caller-supplied identity.', 'Serialized approval response for subsequent command approval fields.', 'Allocation only;issuance and later consumption outside record.', 'Server-to-client authorization capability boundary;with-copy modifying Action does not change registry real action.', 'Handler persists approval before creating result;record has no registry access.', 'Manager name attribution displayed but not a second identity login or paper approval.', 'Constant scalar copy/hash;no generated expiry/network callback.', 'Value equality cannot tell replay/consumed/expired;same token fields copied into requests remain one approval,not newly minted capability.', ['Do not treat result timestamp or modified with-copy as registry validation'], ['JSON contains no Pin,registry rejects modified action/reuse/expiry independently;no live API test'], ['IssueManagerApprovalRequest.cs15-16','IssueManagerApprovalHandler.cs42-46','AuthorizationPolicy.IssueManagerApproval/AuthorizeCommand','EfApprovalRegistry consume paths'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Audit/AuditEventDto.cs',3),row('AuditEventDto projects persisted audit identity/actor role,action/category/details/severity/time and optional shift/device/reason/authorizedBy/old/new values/operation/reference. Generated record constructor validates none and ToString includes full history payloads;copy/equality is value-based on scalar strings/time,not chain-of-custody or tamper verification. AuditQueryService.ToDto32-35 maps existing row directly and read route gates separately. PreviousValue/NewValue may themselves be JSON strings,which remain opaque rather than recursively validated by generated properties.', 'Seventeen stored projection fields,including potentially sensitive old/new JSON text.', 'Read-side audit transport row,not AuditEvent write command.', 'No persistence/log append from constructor or generated members.', 'Audit data disclosure/sanitization boundary;ToString can expand PII/config values,no general safe logging guarantee.', 'AuditQueryService17-35 actual range/filter/limit query;DTO no SQL or immutable ledger guarantee.', 'UI audit screen must distinguish missing optional fields and escape text;not device action.', 'Strings can be large;record hash/equals scans string content but no nested JSON parsing.', 'with-copy can fabricate display attribution in memory;must not feed result into security decisions. IDs do not include cryptographic signature.', ['Generated value semantics provide no integrity/authenticity audit guarantee'], ['Large old/new strings,null optional fields,JSON roundtrip escaped text,source mapping fields and safe rendering'], ['AuditEventDto.cs3-6','Infrastructure/Audit/AuditQueryService.cs17-35','CashierWinUI/ApiClient.GetAuditEventsAsync356-358','DailyStatementQueryService.BuildAuditTrail'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Users/UserSummaryDto.cs',3),row('UserSummaryDto carries Id,Name,Role and IReadOnlyList Permissions;no Pin/hash/token. Server ToUserSummary splits stored comma permission string into list. Generated constructor/copy keeps permission list reference,so IReadOnlyList is not deep immutable and record equality compares list reference rather than effective permission-set equivalence. UI may use it for navigation,but backend reloads permissions for commands and summary equality cannot authorize requests.', 'Identity/display role and permission-name list from server.', 'Login picker/current-user summary transport.', 'Allocation only,no user creation or permission mutation.', 'Server user metadata disclosure separate endpoint gate;client can mutate own backing list without acquiring server authority.', 'Program.ToUserSummary2257+ producer,record no SQL.', 'Role/permissions drive shell visibility,not authoritative capability token.', 'Permission list serialization/copy proportional count;no secret fields in ToString but permission list may be nontrivial metadata.', 'Order/duplicates in list do not give set equality;with shares list. Use content/set comparison if caching UI changes.', ['Do not rely on record== for permission-change detection or backend authorization'], ['Equivalent differently allocated permission lists,with alias,duplicate/order entries and no secret serialization'], ['UserSummaryDto.cs3','Program.csToUserSummary2257+','MainViewModel.HasAnyManagementPermission','AppSession.HasPermission'])),
